<div class="page-wrapper">
    <NavBanner />
    <div id="cards" class="main-wrapper">
      <section class="section-hero cs height-auto">
        <div id="banner-trigger" class="nav_banner-trigger"></div>
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1280 w-container">
          <div class="wrapper-hero flex middle-align">
            <div class="left-hero max-640">
              <div class="gap-4">
                <div class="w-layout-hflex flex-block-2">
                  <a href="#" class="text-caps">Customer stories</a>
                  <div class="text-caps hide">&gt;</div>
                  <div class="text-caps">AI ENGINEER SUMMIT</div>
                </div>
                <h1 class="h1"><span class="span-pink-2">Empowering AI Engineer Summit:</span> 200+ assets in 8 weeks</h1>
              </div>
              <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80 margin-top-40">Motion The Agency was delighted to collaborate with the AI Engineer Summit, a leading event for AI professionals. To enhance the attendee experience and maximize the event&#x27;s impact, our team was entrusted with crafting comprehensive content designed to engage, inform, and inspire, covering their <a href="/services/branded-motion" class="link-25">branded motion</a>, <a href="/services/2d-animation" class="link-26">2D videos</a>, and <a href="/services/explainer-video" class="link-27">explainer video</a> content to create a cohesive visual experience across the event and its wider promotional materials.</div>
              <div class="aie-overview">
                <div class="overview-text">
                  <div class="h3">Project overview</div>
                  <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80 left">Over 200 unique assets delivered in just 2 months, covering a diverse range of formats for social media, video, and event branding.</div>
                </div><img src="/images/AI-Engineering---02_1.avif" loading="lazy" alt="A white square with a white background" class="image-16">
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-w-id="a4d8dbad-85c5-de77-8404-4042222bdb2e" class="right_side-hero">
              <div class="card is-block">
                <div style="padding-top:56.17021276595745%" class="w-embed-youtubevideo youtube-2 z-index-3 rounded-12"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/uDxVsqDaQhk?rel=0&amp;controls=1&amp;autoplay=0&amp;mute=1&amp;start=0" frameborder="0" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:auto" allow="autoplay; encrypted-media" allowfullscreen="" title="Motion x AI Engineer - Partnership Sizzle Reel"></iframe></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <div class="cover">
        <div class="div-block-48"><img src="/images/AI-Engineer-Cover_1.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/AI-Engineer-Cover_1AI-Engineer-Cover.avif 500w, /images/AI-Engineer-Cover_1AI-Engineer-Cover.avif 800w, /images/AI-Engineer-Cover_1AI-Engineer-Cover.avif 1080w, /images/AI-Engineer-Cover_1AI-Engineer-Cover.avif 1600w, /images/AI-Engineer-Cover_1.avif 3200w" alt="A picture of a man with a name tag on it" class="image-17"></div>
      </div>
      <section class="section-process padding-btm-80">
        <div class="line-gradient-2"></div><img src="/images/Frame-1707478761_1.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/Frame-1707478761_1Frame-1707478761.avif 800w, /images/Frame-1707478761_1.avif 3201w" alt="A black and white photo of the moon and stars" class="image-process-2">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1280 m-container-purpose w-container">
          <div class="wrapper-purpose">
            <div class="top-purpose">
              <div class="left-top-purpose large">
                <div class="gap-4-purpose">
                  <div class="text-12-caps opacity-60">Solution</div>
                  <div>
                    <h2 class="h1"><span class="span-pink-2">Streamlined content creation</span><br> for AI Engineer Summit</h2>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-16-150 opacity-80">To meet the AI Engineer Summit&#x27;s need for diverse, high-quality content on a tight deadline, we worked closely with their team to streamline our process. By leveraging our <a href="#" class="link-29">subscription package </a>and our experience with <a href="https://www.motiontheagency.com/blog/the-future-of-ai-in-motion-graphics-will-it-replace-designers-or-enhance-creativity" class="link-28">AI in motion design</a>, we created a wealth of excellent content while maintaining a consistent brand voice and visual style. Here’s how we approached it: </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bottom_side-why_choose-corporate">
              <div id="w-node-daff0b94-5a97-a8e3-c89e-d156e82da2a7-91e7ab44" class="card-contaiiner">
                <div class="card">
                  <div class="card-content-why_choose-corporate ai-engineer"><img sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/AI-Engineer---Solution-01_1AI-Engineer---Solution-01.avif 500w, /images/AI-Engineer---Solution-01_1.avif 1260w" alt="A set of three screens with a purple background" src="/images/AI-Engineer---Solution-01_1.avif" loading="lazy" class="img-why_choose-corporate ai-engineer">
                    <div class="gap-20-center-purpose left-small padding-tb">
                      <div class="icon-wrapper"><img src="/images/Frame-1707478816.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""></div>
                      <h3 class="h3">Content planning</h3>
                      <div class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Collaborated closely with the AI Engineer Summit team to define the overall content strategy and identify specific asset requirements.</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-contaiiner">
                <div class="card business">
                  <div class="card-content">
                    <div class="gap-28-purpose height-auto"><img src="/images/AI-Engineer---Solution-02.avif" loading="lazy" alt="A screen shot of a game with a team b and team b" class="img-purpose">
                      <div class="text-wrapper-business-2">
                        <h3 class="h3">Dedicated PM</h3>
                        <div class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Assigned project managers to specific content categories, ensuring clear communication and efficient task delegation.</div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-contaiiner">
                <div class="card business">
                  <div class="card-content">
                    <div class="gap-28-purpose height-auto"><img src="/images/AI-Engineer---Solution-03.avif" loading="lazy" alt="A set of four different screens with a purple background" class="img-purpose">
                      <div class="text-wrapper-business-2">
                        <h3 class="h3">Visual planning</h3>
                        <div class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Utilized Figma for storyboarding and visual planning, ensuring that all content aligned with the overall event theme and branding.</div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-contaiiner">
                <div class="card business">
                  <div class="card-content">
                    <div class="gap-28-purpose height-auto"><img src="/images/AI-Engineer---Solution-04.avif" loading="lazy" alt="A set of three different screens with a purple background" class="img-purpose">
                      <div class="text-wrapper-business-2">
                        <h3 class="h3">Quality control</h3>
                        <div class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Implemented a rigorous review process for each piece of content, ensuring that it met the highest standards of quality and accuracy.</div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-contaiiner">
                <div class="card business">
                  <div class="card-content">
                    <div class="gap-28-purpose height-auto"><img src="/images/AI-Engineer---Solution-05.avif" loading="lazy" alt="A black and white photo of a play button" class="img-purpose">
                      <div class="text-wrapper-business-2">
                        <h3 class="h3">Flexibility &amp; adaptability</h3>
                        <div class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Maintained a flexible approach to accommodate last-minute changes or requests, ensuring that the content remained relevant and up-to-date.</div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
